abstract: >-
  Browser-based deterministic simulation and statistical evaluation of strategies
  for the 2-player card game Skip-Bo: seeded reproducibility (per-run and per-game
  seeds), shared simulation runs validated and re-simulated in CI, CSV/JSON export,
  and a scientific analysis paper on a deterministic HPVP agent.
